#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Forward-mode automatic differentiation over Luna Flow algebraic and arithmetic structures."
msgstr "基于 Luna Flow 代数与算术结构的前向模式自动微分。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:1
msgid "autodiff API"
msgstr "autodiff API"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:3
