msgstr "导入"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:22
msgid "All names below are then available as `@autodiff.<name>`, and trait methods as `@autodiff.<Trait>::<method>`."
msgstr "之后，下列所有名称都可以通过 `@autodiff.<name>` 访问，trait 方法则通过 `@autodiff.<Trait>::<method>` 访问。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:25
msgid "Dual numbers"
msgstr "对偶数"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:29
msgid "The dual number $a + b\\varepsilon$; see the [dual API](dual.md) for its methods and instances."
msgstr "对偶数 $a + b\\varepsilon$；其方法和实例见 [dual API](dual.md)。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:36
msgid "Scalar drivers"
msgstr "标量驱动函数"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:40
msgid "Returns $(f(x), f'(x))$ from one evaluation of `f` on `Dual::variable(x)`. Defined in [`forward`](forward.md#value_and_diff)."
msgstr "在 `Dual::variable(x)` 上对 `f` 求值一次，返回 $(f(x), f'(x))$。定义于 [`forward`](forward.md#value_and_diff)。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:49
msgid "Returns $f'(x)$. Defined in [`forward`](forward.md#diff)."
msgstr "返回 $f'(x)$。定义于 [`forward`](forward.md#diff)。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:62
msgid "Algebraic traits"
msgstr "代数 trait"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:64
msgid "These traits come from [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/). They are re-exported so that generic code can name its bounds through one import. `Dual[T]` implements each of them when `T` does."
msgstr "这些 trait 来自 [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/)。重新导出它们是为了让泛型代码只需一次导入就能写出所需的约束。当 `T` 实现了其中某个 trait 时，`Dual[T]` 也会实现它。"

