msgstr "在本仓库中的用途"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:70
msgid "additive identity `zero()`"
msgstr "加法单位元 `zero()`"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:70
msgid "`Dual::constant`, seeding"
msgstr "`Dual::constant`，种子设定"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:71
msgid "multiplicative identity `one()`"
msgstr "乘法单位元 `one()`"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:71
msgid "`Dual::variable`, seeding"
msgstr "`Dual::variable`，种子设定"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:72
#: manual/api/autodiff.md:73
msgid "instance on `Dual[T]`"
msgstr "`Dual[T]` 上的实例"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:74
msgid "instance on `Dual[T]` for `T : Semiring`"
msgstr "`T : Semiring` 时 `Dual[T]` 上的实例"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:75
msgid "bound of every `poly` function"
msgstr "所有 `poly` 函数的约束"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:76
msgid "typical bound of generic differentiable code"
msgstr "泛型可微代码的典型约束"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:77
msgid "`from_natural(n)`, the map from the natural numbers"
msgstr "`from_natural(n)`，从自然数出发的映射"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:77
msgid "supertrait of `FromInteger`"
msgstr "`FromInteger` 的超 trait"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:78
msgid "`from_integer(n)`, the map from the integers"
msgstr "`from_integer(n)`，从整数出发的映射"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:78
msgid "constants $2$ and $10$ in the elementary rules; integer literals in generic code"
msgstr "初等函数规则中的常数 $2$ 和 $10$；泛型代码中的整数字面量"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:94
msgid "The additive identity; `Dual` implements it as $0 + 0\\varepsilon$."
msgstr "加法单位元；`Dual` 将其实现为 $0 + 0\\varepsilon$。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:98
msgid "The multiplicative identity; `Dual` implements it as $1 + 0\\varepsilon$."
msgstr "乘法单位元；`Dual` 将其实现为 $1 + 0\\varepsilon$。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:102
msgid "Addition with a zero. `Dual[T]` is an additive monoid when `T` is."
msgstr "带零元的加法。当 `T` 是加法幺半群时，`Dual[T]` 也是。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:106
msgid "An additive monoid with negation and subtraction."
msgstr "带取负和减法的加法幺半群。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:110
msgid "Multiplication with a one."
msgstr "带单位元的乘法。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:114
msgid "Additive and multiplicative monoids with distributivity."
msgstr "满足分配律的加法幺半群与乘法幺半群。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:118
msgid "A semiring with negation and subtraction."
msgstr "带取负和减法的半环。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:122
msgid "The canonical map from the natural numbers, taking a `BigInt`; `from_natural(n)` on `Dual[T]` is `Dual::constant(from_natural(n))`."
msgstr "从自然数出发的典范映射，参数为 `BigInt`；`Dual[T]` 上的 `from_natural(n)` 即 `Dual::constant(from_natural(n))`。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:127
msgid "The canonical map from the integers, taking a `BigInt`; `from_integer(n)` on `Dual[T]` is `Dual::constant(from_integer(n))`. It extends `FromNat`. To convert an `Int` or another integral value, use `@lg.lift_to` from `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`, which is not re-exported."
msgstr "从整数出发的典范映射，参数为 `BigInt`；`Dual[T]` 上的 `from_integer(n)` 即 `Dual::constant(from_integer(n))`。它扩展了 `FromNat`。要转换 `Int` 或其他整数类型的值，请使用 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 中的 `@lg.lift_to`，根包不重新导出它。"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:144
msgid "Arithmetic traits"
msgstr "算术 trait"

#: manual/api/autodiff.md:146
msgid "These traits come from [arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/). `Dual[T]` implements each of them under the bounds listed in the [dual API](dual.md#trait-instances)."
msgstr "这些 trait 来自 [arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/)。`Dual[T]` 在 [dual API](dual.md#trait-instances) 所列的约束下实现其中每一个。"

