#: manual/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: manual/architecture.md:3
msgid "This guide shows how the packages of `autodiff` depend on each other and on the rest of Luna Flow, and which invariants keep the layers apart."
msgstr "本指南展示 `autodiff` 的各个包之间以及它们与 Luna Flow 其余部分之间的依赖关系，以及哪些不变量使各层保持分离。"

#: manual/architecture.md:6
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "分层"

#: manual/architecture.md:8
msgid "`Dual[T]` is defined once, in `dual`, so that its methods and trait instances live with the type. Everything else either re-exports it or uses it:"
msgstr "`Dual[T]` 只在 `dual` 中定义一次，这样它的方法和 trait 实例都与类型放在一起。其他所有包要么重新导出它，要么使用它："

