#: manual/index.md:102
msgid "The [autodiff tutorial](tutorial/autodiff.md) differentiates a function with one import. The [dual API](api/dual.md) lists every rule and instance of the number type, and the [dual design](design/dual.md) derives them, with the rounding error bounds and the comparison with finite differences."
msgstr "[autodiff 教程](tutorial/autodiff.md) 只用一次导入就对函数求导。[dual API](api/dual.md) 列出了该数值类型的所有规则和实例，[dual 设计](design/dual.md) 推导了它们，并给出舍入误差界以及与有限差分的比较。"

#: manual/index.md:107
msgid "New to automatic differentiation: read the [autodiff tutorial](tutorial/autodiff.md), then the [dual tutorial](tutorial/dual.md), which compares dual numbers with finite differences."
msgstr "初次接触自动微分：先读 [autodiff 教程](tutorial/autodiff.md)，再读 [dual 教程](tutorial/dual.md)，其中将对偶数与有限差分进行了比较。"

#: manual/index.md:111
msgid "Using it in a library: import `Luna-Flow/autodiff` and keep the [autodiff API](api/autodiff.md) and the [dual API](api/dual.md) at hand; add the [linalg tutorial](tutorial/linalg.md) or the [poly tutorial](tutorial/poly.md) for vectors and polynomials, and the [checked tutorial](tutorial/checked.md) when failures must be values."
msgstr "在库中使用：导入 `Luna-Flow/autodiff`，并将 [autodiff API](api/autodiff.md) 和 [dual API](api/dual.md) 放在手边；涉及向量和多项式时再阅读 [linalg 教程](tutorial/linalg.md) 或 [poly 教程](tutorial/poly.md)，需要把失败作为值处理时阅读 [checked 教程](tutorial/checked.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:116
msgid "Contributing: read the [dual design](design/dual.md) for the algebra, the derivative rules and the error bounds that every new operation must respect, then the [architecture guide](architecture.md), the [repository conventions](conventions.md) and the design page of the package you change."
msgstr "参与贡献：阅读 [dual 设计](design/dual.md)，了解每个新运算都必须遵守的代数结构、求导规则和误差界，然后阅读 [架构指南](architecture.md)、[仓库约定](conventions.md) 以及你要修改的包的设计页面。"

