#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:1
msgid "checked tutorial"
msgstr "checked 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:3
msgid "This tutorial differentiates code that can fail. You will call the checked division and square root on dual numbers, propagate their errors through a computation, and write generic checked code that runs on plain and dual numbers. The reasoning is in the [checked design](../design/checked.md)."
msgstr "本教程对可能失败的代码求导。你将在对偶数上调用带检查的除法和平方根，在计算中传播它们的错误，并编写能同时在普通数和对偶数上运行的泛型带检查代码。背后的原理见 [checked 设计](../design/checked.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:10
msgid "divide and get an error on a zero divisor"
msgstr "做除法并在除数为零时得到错误"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:11
msgid "take a square root and get an error at $a \\le 0$"
msgstr "开平方并在 $a \\le 0$ 时得到错误"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:12
msgid "build the context"
msgstr "构造上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:13
msgid "find out what failed"
msgstr "查明失败的原因"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:14
msgid "write one checked function for scalars and duals"
msgstr "为标量和对偶数编写同一个带检查的函数"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:14
msgid "bounds `T : DivChecked + SqrtChecked`"
msgstr "约束 `T : DivChecked + SqrtChecked`"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:46
msgid "Inspect the failure"
msgstr "检查失败信息"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:66
msgid "Chain checked steps"
msgstr "串联带检查的步骤"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:68
msgid "Each step returns a `Result`; stop at the first error:"
msgstr "每一步都返回一个 `Result`；在遇到第一个错误时停止："

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:104
msgid "At the origin the square root is evaluated at $0$, where it has no derivative, so the chain stops there."
msgstr "在原点处，平方根在 $0$ 处求值，而它在那里没有导数，因此链条在此停止。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:107
msgid "Generic checked code"
msgstr "泛型的带检查代码"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:109
msgid "Bound the function by the checked traits; it then runs on `Double` and on `Dual[Double]`:"
msgstr "用带检查的 trait 约束函数；这样它就能在 `Double` 和 `Dual[Double]` 上运行："

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:146
msgid "`ArithmeticContext::new(precision, rounding=…)` builds the context for scalar types that use it; `Double` and `Float` ignore it."
msgstr "`ArithmeticContext::new(precision, rounding=…)` 为使用上下文的标量类型构建上下文；`Double` 和 `Float` 会忽略它。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:148
msgid "Functions passed to `@autodiff.diff` can use the checked operations; the [forward tutorial](forward.md#differentiate-through-a-checked-operation) shows how to carry the error out of the closure."
msgstr "传给 `@autodiff.diff` 的函数可以使用带检查的运算；[forward 教程](forward.md#differentiate-through-a-checked-operation) 展示了如何把错误带出闭包。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:151
msgid "A custom scalar type takes part by implementing `DivChecked` and `SqrtChecked`; its errors then appear unchanged in dual results."
msgstr "自定义标量类型只需实现 `DivChecked` 和 `SqrtChecked` 即可参与；其错误随后会原样出现在对偶数结果中。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:156
msgid "**`sqrt_checked` fails at zero.** The derivative does not exist there, even when the input is a constant."
msgstr "**`sqrt_checked` 在零处失败。** 那里的导数不存在，即使输入是常数也是如此。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:158
msgid "**Tiny and huge divisors.** $c^2$ rounds to zero for $|c| < 1.57 \\times 10^{-162}$, and the tangent division then fails (a division by zero, or a domain error when the numerator is zero too). For $|c| > 1.34 \\times 10^{154}$ it overflows, and `div_checked` returns `Ok` with tangent $0$. Rescale such divisors."
msgstr "**极小和极大的除数。** 当 $|c| < 1.57 \\times 10^{-162}$ 时 $c^2$ 被舍入为零，此时切向分量的除法失败（除以零；若分子也为零则为定义域错误）。当 $|c| > 1.34 \\times 10^{154}$ 时它上溢，`div_checked` 返回切向分量为 $0$ 的 `Ok`。请对这类除数做缩放。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:163
msgid "**Unchecked operators stay unchecked.** `x / y` and `x.sqrt()` on dual numbers never return errors; use the `_checked` forms."
msgstr "**不带检查的运算符仍然不带检查。** 对偶数上的 `x / y` 和 `x.sqrt()` 从不返回错误；请使用 `_checked` 形式。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:168
msgid "The [checked API](../api/checked.md) lists the re-exported names."
msgstr "[checked API](../api/checked.md) 列出了重新导出的名称。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:169
msgid "The [dual API](../api/dual.md#checked-operations) gives the exact error table."
msgstr "[dual API](../api/dual.md#checked-operations) 给出了精确的错误表。"

#: manual/tutorial/checked.md:171
msgid "[arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) documents the error model."
msgstr "[arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 记录了错误模型。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:1
msgid "core tutorial"
msgstr "core 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:3
msgid "This tutorial writes ring-level generic code with the `core` facade and differentiates it. You will define functions once for any ring, run them on integers, floating-point numbers and dual numbers, and build integer constants inside generic code. The background is in the [core design](../design/core.md)."
msgstr "本教程用 `core` 门面包编写环层面的泛型代码并对其求导。你将为任意环一次性定义函数，在整数、浮点数和对偶数上运行它们，并在泛型代码中构造整数常量。背景知识见 [core 设计](../design/core.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:11
msgid "write ring-level generic code"
msgstr "编写环层次的泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:12
msgid "use an integer constant in generic code"
msgstr "在泛型代码中使用整数常量"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:12
msgid "`@ad_core.FromInteger::from_integer(n)`, or `@lg.lift_to(n)` for an `Int`"
msgstr "`@ad_core.FromInteger::from_integer(n)`；对 `Int` 可用 `@lg.lift_to(n)`"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:13
msgid "start a sum or a product"
msgstr "开始一次求和或求积"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:14
msgid "differentiate that code"
msgstr "对这段代码求导"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:14
msgid "call it on `@ad_core.Dual::variable(x)`"
msgstr "在 `@ad_core.Dual::variable(x)` 上调用它"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:49
msgid "Integer constants in generic code"
msgstr "泛型代码中的整数常量"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:51
msgid "Literals have a fixed type; inside a generic function, make constants with `FromInteger::from_integer`, which takes a `BigInt` literal such as `2N`:"
msgstr "字面量具有固定的类型；在泛型函数中，请用 `FromInteger::from_integer` 构造常量，它接受 `2N` 这样的 `BigInt` 字面量："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:71
msgid "On `Dual[T]`, `from_integer` produces constants with tangent zero. For an integer held in an `Int` (or another integral type), `@lg.lift_to(n)` from `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` converts it through the same map; the older `IntegralHomomorphism::from_integral` is deprecated."
msgstr "在 `Dual[T]` 上，`from_integer` 产生切向分量为零的常数。对于存放在 `Int`（或其他整数类型）中的整数，`Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 中的 `@lg.lift_to(n)` 会通过同一个映射进行转换；旧的 `IntegralHomomorphism::from_integral` 已被弃用。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:76
msgid "Identities"
msgstr "单位元"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:78
msgid "`Zero::zero()` and `One::one()` are constants of any ring, including `Dual[T]`:"
msgstr "`Zero::zero()` 和 `One::one()` 是任意环（包括 `Dual[T]`）中的常数："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:100
msgid "Generic code over a semiring"
msgstr "基于半环的泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:102
msgid "Code that needs no subtraction can ask for `Semiring` only, so it also accepts unsigned integers:"
msgstr "不需要减法的代码可以只要求 `Semiring`，这样它也能接受无符号整数："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:128
msgid "The same generic functions can be passed to `@autodiff.diff`, see the [forward tutorial](forward.md)."
msgstr "同样的泛型函数也可以传给 `@autodiff.diff`，见 [forward 教程](forward.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:130
msgid "For `sqrt`, `exp`, `sin` and friends you need the analytic traits; import [`elementary`](elementary.md) or the root package."
msgstr "`sqrt`、`exp`、`sin` 等函数需要解析 trait；请导入 [`elementary`](elementary.md) 或根包。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:132
msgid "Your own number type joins by implementing the `luna-generic` traits; it then works both directly and as the `T` of `Dual[T]`."
msgstr "你自己的数值类型只需实现 `luna-generic` 的 trait 即可加入；之后它既能直接使用，也能作为 `Dual[T]` 中的 `T`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:137
msgid "**No division.** `core` has no `Field`; use the `Div` operator on concrete types or the [checked](checked.md) facade."
msgstr "**没有除法。** `core` 不提供 `Field`；请在具体类型上使用 `Div` 运算符，或使用 [checked](checked.md) 门面包。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:139
msgid "**`one()` is not the variable.** `One::one()` on `Dual[T]` has tangent zero; seed the variable with `Dual::variable`."
msgstr "**`one()` 不是变量。** `Dual[T]` 上的 `One::one()` 切向分量为零；请用 `Dual::variable` 设定变量的种子。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:141
msgid "**Unsigned types stop at `Semiring`.** `UInt` has no `Ring` instance, so functions bounded by `Ring` do not accept it."
msgstr "**无符号类型止步于 `Semiring`。** `UInt` 没有 `Ring` 实例，因此以 `Ring` 为约束的函数不接受它。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:146
msgid "The [core API](../api/core.md) lists the re-exported traits and their `Dual[T]` instances."
msgstr "[core API](../api/core.md) 列出了重新导出的 trait 及其 `Dual[T]` 实例。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:148
msgid "The [dual design](../design/dual.md) proves the ring laws of $T[\\varepsilon]$."
msgstr "[dual 设计](../design/dual.md) 证明了 $T[\\varepsilon]$ 满足环的定律。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:150
msgid "[luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) documents the trait hierarchy."
msgstr "[luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) 记录了 trait 层次结构。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:1
msgid "dual tutorial"
msgstr "dual 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:3
msgid "This tutorial computes derivatives by hand with `Dual[T]`: you seed the inputs, run ordinary arithmetic, and read the derivative from the tangent. By the end you can differentiate expressions of several variables in any direction, write one generic function for plain and dual numbers, and handle division and square-root failures as data. The mathematics is in the [dual design](../design/dual.md)."
msgstr "本教程用 `Dual[T]` 手动计算导数：为输入设定种子，执行普通的算术运算，再从切向分量中读出导数。学完之后，你将能够沿任意方向对多变量表达式求导，为普通数和对偶数编写同一个泛型函数，并把除法和平方根的失败作为数据处理。相关数学见 [dual 设计](../design/dual.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:12
msgid "seed the differentiation variable"
msgstr "播种求导变量"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:13
msgid "bring in a constant"
msgstr "引入常数"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:14
msgid "seed an arbitrary direction"
msgstr "播种任意方向"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:15
msgid "read the result"
msgstr "读取结果"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:16
msgid "differentiate through `exp`, `sin`, ..."
msgstr "对 `exp`、`sin` 等求导"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:16
msgid "the methods `x.exp()`, `x.sin()`, ..."
msgstr "方法 `x.exp()`、`x.sin()` 等"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:17
#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:14
msgid "get a second derivative"
msgstr "求二阶导数"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:17
msgid "`Dual[Dual[T]]` with a generic function"
msgstr "对泛型函数使用 `Dual[Dual[T]]`"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:21
msgid "Add the module to your project:"
msgstr "将该模块添加到你的项目中："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:27
msgid "Import the root package in your `moon.pkg`; it re-exports `Dual` and the traits used below:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入根包；它重新导出了 `Dual` 以及下文用到的 trait："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:36
msgid "Seed $x = 1.5$ as the variable and evaluate $f(x) = x^3 + 2x$:"
msgstr "将 $x = 1.5$ 设为变量，并计算 $f(x) = x^3 + 2x$："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:53
msgid "The tangent is $f'(1.5) = 3 \\cdot 1.5^2 + 2 = 8.75$."
msgstr "切向分量为 $f'(1.5) = 3 \\cdot 1.5^2 + 2 = 8.75$。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:57
msgid "Mix constants into a computation"
msgstr "在计算中混入常数"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:59
msgid "Every value that is not the differentiation variable enters as a constant with tangent zero. Literals cannot be mixed with dual numbers directly, so wrap them with `Dual::constant`:"
msgstr "所有不是求导变量的值都以切向分量为零的常数形式参与计算。字面量不能直接与对偶数混用，因此要用 `Dual::constant` 包装："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:76
msgid "Use the elementary functions"
msgstr "使用初等函数"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:78
msgid "`sqrt`, `exp`, `exp2`, `ln`, `log2`, `log10`, `sin`, `cos` and `tan` are methods of `Dual[T]` and apply the chain rule for you:"
msgstr "`sqrt`、`exp`、`exp2`、`ln`、`log2`、`log10`、`sin`、`cos` 和 `tan` 都是 `Dual[T]` 的方法，会自动为你应用链式法则："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:97
msgid "The second and third lines agree: the tangent is $\\cos(1)\\,e^{\\sin 1}$."
msgstr "第二行和第三行一致：切向分量为 $\\cos(1)\\,e^{\\sin 1}$。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:99
msgid "Differentiate in a chosen direction"
msgstr "沿选定方向求导"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:101
msgid ""
"With several inputs, the tangents you seed choose the direction. Seeding $(x, y) = (2, 3)$ with tangents $(1, 0)$ gives $\\partial f/\\partial x$; tangents $(v_1, v_2)$ give the directional derivative $\\n"
"abla f \\cdot v$:"
msgstr ""
"有多个输入时，你设定的切向分量决定了方向。以 $(x, y) = (2, 3)$、切向分量 $(1, 0)$ 设定种子，得到 $\\partial f/\\partial x$；切向分量取 $(v_1, v_2)$，则得到方向导数 $\\n"
"abla f \\cdot v$："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:126
msgid "For whole gradients and Jacobians, the [linalg tutorial](linalg.md) does this seeding for you."
msgstr "对于完整的梯度和雅可比矩阵，[linalg 教程](linalg.md) 中的驱动函数会替你完成这种种子设定。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:129
msgid "Compare with a finite difference"
msgstr "与有限差分比较"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:131
msgid "A central difference needs a step size and loses digits; the dual result is exact up to rounding:"
msgstr "中心差分需要选择步长，并会损失有效数字；对偶数的结果除舍入外是精确的："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:157
msgid "The finite-difference error first falls with $h$ and then rises again as cancellation takes over, exactly as derived in the [dual design](../design/dual.md#comparison-with-finite-differences)."
msgstr "有限差分的误差先随 $h$ 减小而下降，随后因抵消误差占主导而再次上升，与 [dual 设计](../design/dual.md#comparison-with-finite-differences) 中的推导完全一致。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:161
msgid "Write one function for plain and dual numbers"
msgstr "为普通数和对偶数编写同一个函数"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:163
msgid "Write the function against the traits it needs. The same code then runs on `Double` and, for derivatives, on `Dual[Double]`. Integer constants come from `FromInteger::from_integer`:"
msgstr "针对函数所需的 trait 编写它。这样同一份代码就能在 `Double` 上运行，求导时也能在 `Dual[Double]` 上运行。整数常量来自 `FromInteger::from_integer`："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:189
msgid "The value computed on dual numbers is bit-for-bit the value computed on `Double`; the tangent is $6x - \\sin x$ at $0.5$."
msgstr "在对偶数上计算出的值与在 `Double` 上计算出的值逐位相同；切向分量是 $6x - \\sin x$ 在 $0.5$ 处的值。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:192
msgid "Report division and square-root failures"
msgstr "报告除法与平方根的失败"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:194
msgid "`div_checked` and `sqrt_checked` return a `Result` with the `arithmetic` error instead of an infinity or NaN:"
msgstr "`div_checked` 和 `sqrt_checked` 返回带有 `arithmetic` 错误的 `Result`，而不是无穷大或 NaN："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:218
msgid "At $0$ the square root exists but its derivative does not, so the tangent division fails."
msgstr "在 $0$ 处平方根存在，但其导数不存在，因此切向分量的除法失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:223
msgid "Second derivatives by nesting"
msgstr "通过嵌套求二阶导数"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:225
msgid "`Dual[T]` is generic, so `T` can itself be a dual number. Differentiating a derivative needs the inner function to be generic, which the [forward tutorial](forward.md) shows with `diff`. By hand:"
msgstr "`Dual[T]` 是泛型的，因此 `T` 本身也可以是对偶数。对导数再求导要求内层函数是泛型的，[forward 教程](forward.md) 用 `diff` 演示了这一点。手动实现如下："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:252
msgid "The two levels are different types, so tangents of the inner and the outer derivative cannot be mixed up."
msgstr "两个层次是不同的类型，因此内层导数和外层导数的切向分量不会混淆。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:255
msgid "Your own scalar type"
msgstr "你自己的标量类型"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:257
msgid "Any `T` with the bounds of the methods you call works. A ring-only type such as `Int` already supports the product rule:"
msgstr "任何满足所调用方法约束的 `T` 都可以使用。像 `Int` 这样只有环结构的类型已经支持乘积法则："

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:272
msgid "To differentiate through `exp` or `sin` with your own type, implement `Exponential` or `Trigonometric` from `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` for it."
msgstr "要让你自己的类型能通过 `exp` 或 `sin` 求导，请为它实现 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 中的 `Exponential` 或 `Trigonometric`。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:277
msgid "**Literals are not dual numbers.** `x * 2.0` does not compile when `x` is a `Dual[Double]`. Write `x * @autodiff.Dual::constant(2.0)`, or use `FromInteger::from_integer(2N)` in generic code."
msgstr "**字面量不是对偶数。** 当 `x` 是 `Dual[Double]` 时，`x * 2.0` 无法编译。请写成 `x * @autodiff.Dual::constant(2.0)`，或在泛型代码中使用 `FromInteger::from_integer(2N)`。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:280
msgid "**Comparisons see only what you compare.** `Dual[T]` has no `<`. Compare `x.value()`; the derivative is then the derivative of the branch taken, so functions such as `abs` written with a branch have the one-sided derivative at the kink."
msgstr "**比较只看到你所比较的东西。** `Dual[T]` 没有 `<`。请比较 `x.value()`；这样得到的导数就是所走分支的导数，因此用分支实现的 `abs` 之类的函数在拐点处得到的是单侧导数。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:284
msgid "**Equality includes the tangent.** `Dual::new(1.0, 0.0) == Dual::new(1.0, 1.0)` is `false`."
msgstr "**相等性包括切向分量。** `Dual::new(1.0, 0.0) == Dual::new(1.0, 1.0)` 为 `false`。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:286
msgid "**Unchecked operations follow `Double`.** `x / y` with `y.value() == 0.0` and `sqrt` or `ln` at zero give infinities or NaN in the tangent, even for a constant input. `ln` of a negative number gives a NaN value but a finite tangent $b/a$, so test the value. Use the checked forms when that must not happen."
msgstr "**不带检查的运算沿用 `Double` 的行为。** 当 `y.value() == 0.0` 时的 `x / y`，以及零处的 `sqrt` 或 `ln`，都会在切向分量中产生无穷大或 NaN，即使输入是常数也是如此。负数的 `ln` 给出 NaN 值，但切向分量 $b/a$ 是有限的，因此请检查值。若必须避免这种情况，请使用带检查的形式。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:291
msgid "**Tiny and huge divisors.** The quotient rule divides by $c^2$, which rounds to zero for $|c| < 1.57 \\times 10^{-162}$ and overflows for $|c| > 1.34 \\times 10^{154}$; in the second case the tangent silently becomes $0$. Rescale before dividing."
msgstr "**极小和极大的除数。** 商的求导法则除以 $c^2$，当 $|c| < 1.57 \\times 10^{-162}$ 时它被舍入为零，当 $|c| > 1.34 \\times 10^{154}$ 时它上溢；后一种情况下切向分量会悄无声息地变成 $0$。请在相除之前做缩放。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:295
msgid "**No printing.** `Dual[T]` has no `Show`. Print `value()` and `tangent()`, or use `debug_inspect` and `@debug.to_string` from `Debug`."
msgstr "**无法直接打印。** `Dual[T]` 没有 `Show`。请打印 `value()` 和 `tangent()`，或使用 `Debug` 提供的 `debug_inspect` 和 `@debug.to_string`。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:300
msgid "The [dual API](../api/dual.md) lists every method, rule and instance."
msgstr "[dual API](../api/dual.md) 列出了每个方法、规则和实例。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:301
msgid "The [dual design](../design/dual.md) derives the rules and the error bounds."
msgstr "[dual 设计](../design/dual.md) 推导了这些规则和误差界。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:303
msgid "The [forward tutorial](forward.md) wraps the seeding in `diff` and `value_and_diff`; the [linalg tutorial](linalg.md) computes gradients and Jacobians; the [poly tutorial](poly.md) differentiates polynomials."
msgstr "[forward 教程](forward.md) 把种子设定封装进 `diff` 和 `value_and_diff`；[linalg 教程](linalg.md) 计算梯度和雅可比矩阵；[poly 教程](poly.md) 对多项式求导。"

#: manual/tutorial/dual.md:306
msgid "The scalar traits come from [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) and [arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/)."
msgstr "标量 trait 来自 [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) 和 [arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/)。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:1
msgid "elementary tutorial"
msgstr "elementary 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:3
msgid "This tutorial differentiates analytic code written against the `arithmetic` traits. You will write a function once with `Exponential`, `Logarithmic` and `Trigonometric` bounds, evaluate it on `Double`, and get its derivative by running it on `Dual[Double]`. The rules behind it are in the [elementary design](../design/elementary.md)."
msgstr "本教程对针对 `arithmetic` trait 编写的解析代码求导。你将以 `Exponential`、`Logarithmic` 和 `Trigonometric` 为约束编写一次函数，在 `Double` 上对其求值，再通过在 `Dual[Double]` 上运行它得到导数。背后的规则见 [elementary 设计](../design/elementary.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:11
msgid "differentiate `exp`, `ln`, `sin`, ..."
msgstr "对 `exp`、`ln`、`sin` 等求导"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:11
msgid "the methods `x.exp()`, `x.ln()`, `x.sin()`, ..."
msgstr "方法 `x.exp()`、`x.ln()`、`x.sin()` 等"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:12
msgid "write generic analytic code"
msgstr "编写泛型的解析代码"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:12
msgid "bounds such as `T : @elementary.Exponential`"
msgstr "诸如 `T : @elementary.Exponential` 的约束"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:13
msgid "use other bases"
msgstr "使用其他底数"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:14
msgid "use $\\pi$, $\\tau$ or $e$"
msgstr "使用 $\\pi$、$\\tau$ 或 $e$"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:15
msgid "a square root that reports errors"
msgstr "会报告错误的平方根"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:47
msgid "The derivative is $2\\sin x\\cos x = \\sin 2x$, here $\\sin 1$."
msgstr "导数为 $2\\sin x\\cos x = \\sin 2x$，此处为 $\\sin 1$。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:51
msgid "Logarithms and exponentials"
msgstr "对数与指数"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:68
msgid "$(e^x \\ln x)' = e^x \\ln x + e^x/x$, which is $e$ at $x = 1$."
msgstr "$(e^x \\ln x)' = e^x \\ln x + e^x/x$，在 $x = 1$ 处为 $e$。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:70
msgid "Other bases"
msgstr "其他底数"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:72
msgid "`exp2`, `log2` and `log10` include the base-change factors:"
msgstr "`exp2`、`log2` 和 `log10` 包含了换底因子："

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:89
msgid "Constants inside generic code"
msgstr "泛型代码中的常数"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:107
msgid "The constant $\\tau = 2\\pi$ has tangent zero, so only $t$ is differentiated."
msgstr "常数 $\\tau = 2\\pi$ 的切向分量为零，因此只对 $t$ 求导。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:109
msgid "The tangent and its poles"
msgstr "正切函数及其极点"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:126
msgid "The derivative $1/\\cos^2 a$ grows without bound towards $\\pi/2$."
msgstr "导数 $1/\\cos^2 a$ 在趋近 $\\pi/2$ 时无界增长。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:130
msgid "Combine the analytic traits with `Ring` from the root package or `core` to write full models; see the [autodiff tutorial](autodiff.md)."
msgstr "将解析 trait 与根包或 `core` 中的 `Ring` 结合，即可编写完整的模型；见 [autodiff 教程](autodiff.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:132
msgid "For a custom scalar, implement `Exponential`, `Logarithmic` and `Trigonometric`; `Dual` of it then differentiates them with the same rules."
msgstr "对于自定义标量，实现 `Exponential`、`Logarithmic` 和 `Trigonometric`；之后它的 `Dual` 就会按相同规则对这些函数求导。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:135
msgid "For domain-checked square roots, use `SqrtChecked`, see the [checked tutorial](checked.md)."
msgstr "需要检查定义域的平方根请使用 `SqrtChecked`，见 [checked 教程](checked.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:140
msgid "**Outside the domain you get NaN or infinity.** `ln` of a non-positive number and `sqrt` at zero are not checked. `ln` of a negative number has a NaN value but a finite tangent, so test the value."
msgstr "**超出定义域会得到 NaN 或无穷大。** 非正数的 `ln` 和零处的 `sqrt` 都不做检查。负数的 `ln` 值为 NaN，但切向分量有限，因此请检查值。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:143
msgid "**The trait instances need more than the method.** Calling `@elementary.Exponential::exp` on `Dual[T]` needs the full instance bound (`Logarithmic` and `FromInteger` on `T`); the method `x.exp()` needs less."
msgstr "**trait 实例需要的比方法更多。** 在 `Dual[T]` 上调用 `@elementary.Exponential::exp` 需要完整的实例约束（`T` 上的 `Logarithmic` 和 `FromInteger`）；方法 `x.exp()` 需要的则更少。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:147
msgid "**No hyperbolic or inverse functions.** `sinh`, `asin`, `atan` and friends have no dual rule yet; compose them from the available functions if you need them."
msgstr "**没有双曲函数或反函数。** `sinh`、`asin`、`atan` 等函数目前还没有对偶规则；如有需要，请用现有函数组合实现。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:153
msgid "The [elementary API](../api/elementary.md) lists the traits and bounds."
msgstr "[elementary API](../api/elementary.md) 列出了这些 trait 及其约束。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:154
msgid "The [dual API](../api/dual.md#elementary-functions) lists every rule as computed."
msgstr "[dual API](../api/dual.md#elementary-functions) 列出了每条规则的实际计算方式。"

#: manual/tutorial/elementary.md:156
msgid "[arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) documents the traits."
msgstr "[arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 记录了这些 trait。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:1
msgid "forward tutorial"
msgstr "forward 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:3
msgid "This tutorial differentiates functions of one variable with `diff` and `value_and_diff`, the shortest way to get derivatives from this repository. You will differentiate closures, named generic functions, functions that call checked operations, and finally compute second derivatives. The background is in the [forward design](../design/forward.md)."
msgstr "本教程用 `diff` 和 `value_and_diff` 对单变量函数求导，这是从本仓库获得导数的最简捷方式。你将对闭包、具名泛型函数以及调用带检查运算的函数求导，最后计算二阶导数。背景知识见 [forward 设计](../design/forward.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:11
msgid "get the derivative at a point"
msgstr "求某一点处的导数"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:12
msgid "get value and derivative in one pass"
msgstr "一遍计算同时得到值和导数"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:13
msgid "differentiate a named function"
msgstr "对具名函数求导"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:13
msgid "make it generic in `T` and pass it to `diff`"
msgstr "把它写成对 `T` 泛型的函数并传给 `diff`"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:14
msgid "`diff(x => diff(f, x), x0)` with a generic `f`"
msgstr "对泛型 `f` 使用 `diff(x => diff(f, x), x0)`"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:15
msgid "differentiate through a checked step"
msgstr "对带检查的步骤求导"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:15
msgid "carry the `Result` out of the closure"
msgstr "把 `Result` 从闭包中带出来"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:40
msgid "The closure receives a `Dual[Double]`, so `*` and `sin` are the dual operations, and `diff` returns $2 \\cdot 2 + \\cos 2$."
msgstr "闭包接收的是 `Dual[Double]`，因此 `*` 和 `sin` 都是对偶运算，`diff` 返回 $2 \\cdot 2 + \\cos 2$。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:45
msgid "Get the value and the derivative together"
msgstr "同时获取值和导数"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:47
msgid "`value_and_diff` returns both from one evaluation:"
msgstr "`value_and_diff` 通过一次求值同时返回两者："

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:62
msgid "$f(x) = e^x / x^2$ has $f'(x) = e^x (x - 2)/x^3$, which vanishes at $x = 2$."
msgstr "$f(x) = e^x / x^2$ 的导数为 $f'(x) = e^x (x - 2)/x^3$，它在 $x = 2$ 处为零。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:64
msgid "Use constants inside the function"
msgstr "在函数内部使用常数"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:66
msgid "Captured numbers must enter as constants:"
msgstr "捕获的数值必须以常数形式参与计算："

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:83
msgid "Differentiate a named generic function"
msgstr "对具名泛型函数求导"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:85
msgid "A function written against the traits can be passed directly; it is instantiated at `Dual[Double]`:"
msgstr "针对 trait 编写的函数可以直接传入；它会在 `Dual[Double]` 处实例化："

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:106
msgid "The derivative is $\\ln x + 1$."
msgstr "导数为 $\\ln x + 1$。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:108
msgid "Find a root with Newton's method"
msgstr "用牛顿法求根"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:110
msgid "`value_and_diff` gives exactly what a Newton step needs, $x \\leftarrow x - f(x)/f'(x)$:"
msgstr "`value_and_diff` 恰好给出牛顿迭代一步所需的内容，即 $x \\leftarrow x - f(x)/f'(x)$："

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:129
msgid "Differentiate through a checked operation"
msgstr "通过带检查的运算求导"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:131
msgid "When `f` uses `div_checked` or `sqrt_checked`, wrap the driver call so the error leaves the closure as a value:"
msgstr "当 `f` 使用 `div_checked` 或 `sqrt_checked` 时，请包装驱动函数的调用，使错误以值的形式离开闭包："

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:171
msgid "Second derivatives"
msgstr "二阶导数"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:173
msgid "Apply `diff` to a function that itself calls `diff`. The inner function must be generic so that it can run on `Dual[Dual[Double]]`:"
msgstr "将 `diff` 应用于一个本身调用了 `diff` 的函数。内层函数必须是泛型的，才能在 `Dual[Dual[Double]]` 上运行："

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:194
msgid "The nested derivative matches the closed form. Each level doubles the number of components and triples the cost of a product, so use this for low orders only."
msgstr "嵌套求得的导数与闭式解一致。每多一层，分量个数翻倍，乘积的代价变为三倍，因此只适用于低阶导数。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:198
msgid "Other scalar types"
msgstr "其他标量类型"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:200
msgid "`diff` works for every `T` with `One`; `Float` and even `Int` are fine when `f` only uses ring operations:"
msgstr "`diff` 适用于任何实现了 `One` 的 `T`；当 `f` 只使用环运算时，`Float` 甚至 `Int` 都可以："

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:216
msgid "**The closure parameter is a dual number.** Write `x.sin()` or `@autodiff.Trigonometric::sin(x)`, not `@math.sin(x)`, which takes a `Double` and does not compile here."
msgstr "**闭包参数是对偶数。** 请写 `x.sin()` 或 `@autodiff.Trigonometric::sin(x)`，而不是 `@math.sin(x)`，后者接受 `Double`，在这里无法编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:219
msgid "**Captured values need `Dual::constant`.** A captured `Dual` that is itself `Dual::variable(…)` adds its own tangent and silently changes the result."
msgstr "**捕获的值需要 `Dual::constant`。** 如果捕获的 `Dual` 本身是 `Dual::variable(…)`，它会加入自己的切向分量，悄无声息地改变结果。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:222
msgid "**Branches.** `if x.value() < 0.0 { … }` differentiates the branch taken. At a kink you get a one-sided derivative."
msgstr "**分支。** `if x.value() < 0.0 { … }` 只对所走的分支求导。在拐点处你得到的是单侧导数。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:224
msgid "**Generic inner functions for nesting.** Nesting `diff` needs the inner function generic in `T`; a closure over `Dual[Double]` cannot be applied to `Dual[Dual[Double]]`."
msgstr "**嵌套需要泛型的内层函数。** 嵌套 `diff` 要求内层函数对 `T` 泛型；作用于 `Dual[Double]` 的闭包不能应用于 `Dual[Dual[Double]]`。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:230
msgid "The [forward API](../api/forward.md) states the exact contract of the drivers."
msgstr "[forward API](../api/forward.md) 给出了驱动函数的确切约定。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:232
msgid "The [dual tutorial](dual.md) seeds tangents by hand, including directional derivatives."
msgstr "[dual 教程](dual.md) 手动设定切向分量的种子，包括方向导数。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:234
msgid "The [linalg tutorial](linalg.md) computes gradients and Jacobians."
msgstr "[linalg 教程](linalg.md) 计算梯度和雅可比矩阵。"

#: manual/tutorial/forward.md:235
msgid "The [forward design](../design/forward.md) explains the method and the cost of nesting."
msgstr "[forward 设计](../design/forward.md) 解释了该方法以及嵌套的代价。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:1
msgid "linalg tutorial"
msgstr "linalg 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:3
msgid "This tutorial computes gradients, Jacobians and Jacobian-vector products of functions on `linear-algebra` vectors. You will write functions over `Vector[Dual[Double]]`, pass them to the `linalg` drivers, and use the results in a small optimization loop. Why the drivers work this way is in the [linalg design](../design/linalg.md)."
msgstr "本教程计算作用于 `linear-algebra` 向量的函数的梯度、雅可比矩阵和雅可比-向量积。你将编写作用于 `Vector[Dual[Double]]` 的函数，把它们传给 `linalg` 驱动函数，并在一个小型优化循环中使用结果。驱动函数为何如此工作见 [linalg 设计](../design/linalg.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:11
msgid "get the gradient of $f : T^n \\to T$"
msgstr "求 $f : T^n \\to T$ 的梯度"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:12
msgid "get the value and the gradient"
msgstr "同时求值和梯度"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:13
msgid "get the Jacobian of $f : T^n \\to T^m$"
msgstr "求 $f : T^n \\to T^m$ 的雅可比矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:14
msgid "get the value and the Jacobian"
msgstr "同时求值和雅可比矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:15
msgid "get a Jacobian-vector product $J_f(x)\\,v$"
msgstr "求雅可比-向量积 $J_f(x)\\,v$"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:15
msgid "seed `Dual::new(x[j], v[j])` and call `f` once"
msgstr "播种 `Dual::new(x[j], v[j])` 并调用一次 `f`"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:44
msgid "For $f(x_0, x_1) = x_0^2 + x_0 x_1$ the gradient is $(2x_0 + x_1,\\ x_0) = (7, 2)$."
msgstr "对于 $f(x_0, x_1) = x_0^2 + x_0 x_1$，梯度为 $(2x_0 + x_1,\\ x_0) = (7, 2)$。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:49
msgid "Gradient of a named function"
msgstr "具名函数的梯度"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:51
msgid "Give the function an explicit type when it is not a closure written in place. Constants enter through `Dual::constant`:"
msgstr "当函数不是就地编写的闭包时，请为它给出显式类型。常数通过 `Dual::constant` 参与计算："

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:78
msgid "Jacobian of a vector function"
msgstr "向量函数的雅可比矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:80
msgid "`jacobian` returns an $m \\times n$ matrix whose row $i$ is the gradient of output $i$. Here, the map from polar to Cartesian coordinates:"
msgstr "`jacobian` 返回一个 $m \\times n$ 矩阵，其第 $i$ 行是第 $i$ 个输出的梯度。这里以极坐标到笛卡儿坐标的映射为例："

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:104
msgid "The determinant of this Jacobian is $r = 2$, the familiar area factor of polar coordinates."
msgstr "这个雅可比矩阵的行列式为 $r = 2$，即熟悉的极坐标面积因子。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:107
msgid "Compute a Jacobian-vector product"
msgstr "计算雅可比-向量积"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:109
msgid "To get $J_f(x)\\,v$ for one direction $v$, seed every input with its direction component and evaluate `f` once:"
msgstr "要对单个方向 $v$ 得到 $J_f(x)\\,v$，请用方向分量为每个输入设定种子，然后对 `f` 求值一次："

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:130
msgid "This costs one evaluation, instead of the $n + 1$ that `jacobian` needs."
msgstr "这只需一次求值，而 `jacobian` 需要 $n + 1$ 次。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:132
msgid "Gradient descent"
msgstr "梯度下降"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:134
msgid "`value_and_gradient` gives what a descent step needs:"
msgstr "`value_and_gradient` 给出下降一步所需的内容："

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:161
msgid "Vector arithmetic on dual vectors"
msgstr "对偶数向量上的向量运算"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:163
msgid "`Vector[Dual[Double]]` supports the vector operations that only need ring structure, so you can write $f(x) = \\tfrac12 x^{\\mathsf T} x + a^{\\mathsf T}x$ with vector operations and a fold:"
msgstr "`Vector[Dual[Double]]` 支持只需要环结构的向量运算，因此你可以用向量运算和一次折叠写出 $f(x) = \\tfrac12 x^{\\mathsf T} x + a^{\\mathsf T}x$："

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:186
msgid "The gradient is $x + a$. `v * v` is the elementwise product of `linear-algebra` vectors."
msgstr "梯度为 $x + a$。`v * v` 是 `linear-algebra` 向量的逐元素乘积。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:189
msgid "Generic functions"
msgstr "泛型函数"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:191
msgid "A function written against the traits can be differentiated and also run on plain numbers. Give it a vector of `T`:"
msgstr "针对 trait 编写的函数既可以求导，也可以在普通数上运行。给它传入一个 `T` 的向量："

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:213
msgid "**Keep the output length fixed.** `jacobian` learns $m$ from the first call; a different length later aborts or loses entries."
msgstr "**保持输出长度固定。** `jacobian` 从第一次调用中得知 $m$；之后若长度不同，会中止或丢失元素。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:215
msgid "**Read only the indices you are given.** The drivers pass vectors of length `x.length()` and do not check accesses."
msgstr "**只读取给定范围内的下标。** 驱动函数传入长度为 `x.length()` 的向量，且不检查访问。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:217
msgid "**Many inputs.** Each input costs one evaluation of `f`. For hundreds of inputs and a cheap reverse-mode alternative elsewhere, forward mode is the slow choice."
msgstr "**输入很多时。** 每个输入都要对 `f` 求值一次。如果有数百个输入，而别处又有廉价的反向模式可用，那么前向模式就是较慢的选择。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:220
msgid "**Captured vectors are constants.** Map them with `Dual::constant` before combining them with the input."
msgstr "**捕获的向量是常数。** 在与输入组合之前，先用 `Dual::constant` 对它们做映射。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:225
msgid "The [linalg API](../api/linalg.md) lists the drivers, their shapes and costs."
msgstr "[linalg API](../api/linalg.md) 列出了驱动函数及其形状和代价。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:227
msgid "The [linalg design](../design/linalg.md) derives the column-by-column method and compares it with reverse mode."
msgstr "[linalg 设计](../design/linalg.md) 推导了逐列计算的方法，并将其与反向模式进行了比较。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:229
msgid "The [dual tutorial](dual.md) shows the seeding the drivers perform."
msgstr "[dual 教程](dual.md) 展示了驱动函数所做的种子设定。"

#: manual/tutorial/linalg.md:230
msgid "[linear-algebra](https://lunaflow.cn/en/linear-algebra/) documents the vector and matrix types."
msgstr "[linear-algebra](https://lunaflow.cn/en/linear-algebra/) 记录了向量和矩阵类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:1
msgid "poly tutorial"
msgstr "poly 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:3
msgid "This tutorial differentiates `luna-poly` polynomials at a point. You will get values and slopes of dense and sparse polynomials, use a polynomial inside a larger differentiated expression, and run Newton's method on a polynomial. The mathematics is in the [poly design](../design/poly.md)."
msgstr "本教程在某点处对 `luna-poly` 多项式求导。你将得到稠密和稀疏多项式的值与斜率，在更大的被求导表达式中使用多项式，并对多项式运行牛顿法。相关数学见 [poly 设计](../design/poly.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:10
msgid "get $p'(x)$ of a dense polynomial"
msgstr "求稠密多项式的 $p'(x)$"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:11
msgid "get $p(x)$ and $p'(x)$ together"
msgstr "同时求 $p(x)$ 和 $p'(x)$"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:12
msgid "differentiate a sparse polynomial in one variable"
msgstr "对一元稀疏多项式求导"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:13
msgid "differentiate a polynomial inside a larger dual computation"
msgstr "对更大的对偶计算中的多项式求导"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:14
msgid "get the derivative polynomial itself"
msgstr "求导数多项式本身"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:14
msgid "`DensePolynomial::derivative` from `luna-poly`"
msgstr "`luna-poly` 中的 `DensePolynomial::derivative`"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:46
msgid "Tabulate a derivative"
msgstr "列出导数值表"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:66
msgid "The derivative $3x^2 - 3$ vanishes at the critical points $\\pm 1$."
msgstr "导数 $3x^2 - 3$ 在临界点 $\\pm 1$ 处为零。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:68
msgid "Exact derivatives of integer polynomials"
msgstr "整数多项式的精确导数"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:70
msgid "Only `Semiring` is required, so integer coefficients give exact results:"
msgstr "只需要 `Semiring`，因此整数系数会得到精确结果："

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:87
msgid "Sparse polynomials with large gaps"
msgstr "间隔很大的稀疏多项式"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:89
msgid "For a polynomial with few terms of high degree, use the sparse representation; each term costs $O(\\log e)$:"
msgstr "对于项数很少而次数很高的多项式，请使用稀疏表示；每一项的代价为 $O(\\log e)$："

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:105
msgid "A polynomial inside a larger expression"
msgstr "在更大的表达式中使用多项式"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:107
msgid "`eval_dual` takes a dual input, so the chain rule continues through it. Here $\\frac{d}{dx}\\,p(\\sin x)$ at $x = 0.5$:"
msgstr "`eval_dual` 接受对偶数输入，因此链式法则会贯穿它继续传播。这里计算 $\\frac{d}{dx}\\,p(\\sin x)$ 在 $x = 0.5$ 处的值："

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:124
msgid "Newton's method on a polynomial"
msgstr "对多项式运行牛顿法"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:145
msgid "Agreement with the formal derivative"
msgstr "与形式导数的一致性"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:147
msgid "`luna-poly` can also build the derivative polynomial. Both routes give the same numbers; evaluation over dual numbers avoids the second polynomial:"
msgstr "`luna-poly` 也能构建导数多项式。两种途径给出相同的数值；在对偶数上求值则无需第二个多项式："

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:163
msgid "Multivariate polynomials"
msgstr "多元多项式"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:165
msgid "The sparse bridge is univariate. To differentiate a contextual polynomial with respect to one variable, evaluate the others first with `ContextPolynomial::eval_partial` from `luna-poly/immut/context`, convert the remaining terms to a sparse polynomial in that variable, and call `sparse_univariate_value_and_derivative_at`. The repository's integration test `src/tests/linalg_poly_test.mbt` shows the complete conversion."
msgstr "稀疏桥接是一元的。要对上下文多项式关于某一个变量求导，请先用 `luna-poly/immut/context` 中的 `ContextPolynomial::eval_partial` 对其他变量求值，把剩余各项转换为关于该变量的稀疏多项式，再调用 `sparse_univariate_value_and_derivative_at`。本仓库的集成测试 `src/tests/linalg_poly_test.mbt` 展示了完整的转换过程。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:174
msgid "**Coefficient order.** `DensePolynomial::from_coefficients` takes $c_0, c_1, \\dots$ from the constant term upwards."
msgstr "**系数顺序。** `DensePolynomial::from_coefficients` 从常数项开始依次接受 $c_0, c_1, \\dots$。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:176
msgid "**A second variable aborts.** `sparse_univariate_*` evaluates with one value; a term in another variable stops the program."
msgstr "**出现第二个变量会中止。** `sparse_univariate_*` 只用一个值求值；含有其他变量的项会使程序终止。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:178
msgid "**Old names.** `derivative_at` and `sparse_derivative_at` are aliases of the `dense_` and `sparse_univariate_` functions, not multivariate versions."
msgstr "**旧名称。** `derivative_at` 和 `sparse_derivative_at` 是 `dense_` 和 `sparse_univariate_` 函数的别名，而不是多元版本。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:181
msgid "**Floating-point cancellation.** Near a multiple root, $p'(x)$ is a small difference of large terms; see the error bound in the [poly design](../design/poly.md#rounding-error-of-the-dense-evaluation)."
msgstr "**浮点抵消。** 在重根附近，$p'(x)$ 是大项之间的微小差值；见 [poly 设计](../design/poly.md#rounding-error-of-the-dense-evaluation) 中的误差界。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:187
msgid "The [poly API](../api/poly.md) lists every function and its alias."
msgstr "[poly API](../api/poly.md) 列出了每个函数及其别名。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:188
msgid "The [poly design](../design/poly.md) derives Horner's rule on dual numbers and its error bound."
msgstr "[poly 设计](../design/poly.md) 推导了对偶数上的 Horner 法则及其误差界。"

#: manual/tutorial/poly.md:190
msgid "[luna-poly](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-poly/) documents the polynomial types."
msgstr "[luna-poly](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-poly/) 记录了多项式类型。"

#~ msgid "Versions of `arithmetic`"
#~ msgstr "`arithmetic` 的版本"

#~ msgid "The checked rules of `Dual[T]` only call `T`'s `div_checked` and `sqrt_checked`, so the errors depend on the `arithmetic` release that provides the `Double` instances. This manual and its examples follow `arithmetic` 0.5, which the repository is developed against in a workspace. `moon.mod` still pins `arithmetic@0.2.1`, where `Double` behaves differently:"
#~ msgstr "`Dual[T]` 的带检查规则只调用 `T` 的 `div_checked` 和 `sqrt_checked`，因此错误取决于提供 `Double` 实例的 `arithmetic` 版本。本手册及其示例以 `arithmetic` 0.5 为准，本仓库在工作区中正是基于该版本开发的。`moon.mod` 仍锁定 `arithmetic@0.2.1`，其中 `Double` 的行为有所不同："

#~ msgid "Operation on `Double`"
#~ msgstr "`Double` 上的运算"

#~ msgid "exists"
#~ msgstr "存在"

#~ msgid "does not exist"
#~ msgstr "不存在"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] With `arithmetic@0.2.1`, `Dual::sqrt_checked` of a negative `Double` returns `Ok` with value and tangent NaN instead of an error. Check `value().is_nan()` until the pin is raised."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 使用 `arithmetic@0.2.1` 时，对负的 `Double` 调用 `Dual::sqrt_checked` 会返回值与切向分量均为 NaN 的 `Ok`，而不是错误。在提高锁定版本之前，请检查 `value().is_nan()`。"

#~ msgid "`from_integral` from integral types"
#~ msgstr "从整数类型出发的 `from_integral`"

#~ msgid "The canonical map from the integers, used for integer constants in generic code."
#~ msgstr "从整数出发的典范映射，用于泛型代码中的整数常量。"

#~ msgid "With the `arithmetic@0.2.1` pinned in `moon.mod`, every zero divisor, including $0/0$, gives `is_division_by_zero()`, and $\\infty/\\infty$ gives NaN without an error (see [versions of arithmetic](checked.md#versions-of-arithmetic))."
#~ msgstr "使用 `moon.mod` 中锁定的 `arithmetic@0.2.1` 时，所有零除数（包括 $0/0$）都给出 `is_division_by_zero()`，而 $\\infty/\\infty$ 不报错，直接给出 NaN（见 [arithmetic 的版本](checked.md#versions-of-arithmetic)）。"

#~ msgid "`from_integral(n)` is `Dual::constant(from_integral(n))`"
#~ msgstr "`from_integral(n)` 即 `Dual::constant(from_integral(n))`"

#~ msgid "`NatHomomorphism::from_nat(n)` from `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`"
#~ msgstr "来自 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 的 `NatHomomorphism::from_nat(n)`"

#~ msgid "`sqrt_checked(x)` succeeds exactly when `T`'s `sqrt_checked(a)` and `div_checked(b, 2√a)` succeed; for `Double` with `arithmetic` 0.5 that is $a > 0$, or $a$ NaN. With `arithmetic@0.2.1` it also succeeds, with NaN components, for $a < 0$, because that release does not check the domain of the square root (see [versions of arithmetic](../api/checked.md#versions-of-arithmetic))."
#~ msgstr "`sqrt_checked(x)` 成功，当且仅当 `T` 的 `sqrt_checked(a)` 和 `div_checked(b, 2√a)` 都成功；对于使用 `arithmetic` 0.5 的 `Double`，即 $a > 0$ 或 $a$ 为 NaN。使用 `arithmetic@0.2.1` 时，对于 $a < 0$ 它也会成功并给出 NaN 分量，因为该版本不检查平方根的定义域（见 [arithmetic 的版本](../api/checked.md#versions-of-arithmetic)）。"

#~ msgid "No `Field`, `MulGroup`, `Inverse` or `NatHomomorphism`."
#~ msgstr "没有 `Field`、`MulGroup`、`Inverse` 或 `NatHomomorphism`。"

#~ msgid "[!IMPORTANT] The checked operations report the errors of `T`'s own `DivChecked` and `SqrtChecked`. This manual describes `Double` as implemented by `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 0.5, the version the repository is developed against. `moon.mod` still pins `arithmetic@0.2.1`, whose `Double` `sqrt_checked` never fails (a negative input gives NaN) and whose `div_checked` reports every zero divisor, including $0/0$, as a division by zero. See the [checked API](api/checked.md#versions-of-arithmetic)."
#~ msgstr "[!IMPORTANT] 带检查的运算报告的是 `T` 自身 `DivChecked` 和 `SqrtChecked` 的错误。本手册按 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 0.5（本仓库开发所基于的版本）描述 `Double`。`moon.mod` 仍锁定 `arithmetic@0.2.1`，其中 `Double` 的 `sqrt_checked` 从不失败（负输入给出 NaN），而 `div_checked` 把所有零除数（包括 $0/0$）都报告为除以零。见 [checked API](api/checked.md#versions-of-arithmetic)。"

#~ msgid "**The pinned `arithmetic` does not check square roots.** With `arithmetic@0.2.1` from `moon.mod`, `sqrt_checked` of a negative `Double` returns NaN components instead of an error; see [versions of arithmetic](../api/checked.md#versions-of-arithmetic)."
#~ msgstr "**锁定的 `arithmetic` 不检查平方根。** 使用 `moon.mod` 中的 `arithmetic@0.2.1` 时，对负的 `Double` 调用 `sqrt_checked` 返回 NaN 分量而不是错误；见 [arithmetic 的版本](../api/checked.md#versions-of-arithmetic)。"

#~ msgid "On `Dual[T]`, `from_integral` produces constants with tangent zero."
#~ msgstr "在 `Dual[T]` 上，`from_integral` 产生切向分量为零的常数。"

#~ msgid "the tangent division fails; see the pitfall below"
#~ msgstr "切向分量的除法失败；见下方的陷阱说明"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] The tangent divides by $c^2$, which leaves the range of `Double` sooner than $c$ itself: for $|c| < 2^{-537} \\approx 1.5\\times10^{-162}$ the square underflows to zero and `div_checked` reports a division by zero even when $a / c$ is finite. Rescale such inputs before dividing."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 切向分量要除以 $c^2$，它比 $c$ 本身更早超出 `Double` 的范围：当 $|c| < 2^{-537} \\approx 1.5\\times10^{-162}$ 时，平方会下溢为零，即使 $a / c$ 是有限值，`div_checked` 也会报告除以零。请在相除之前对这类输入重新缩放。"

#~ msgid "The root package defines no functions, types or instances; its `pkg.generated.mbti` contains only `pub using` lines."
#~ msgstr "根包不定义任何函数、类型或实例；它的 `pkg.generated.mbti` 只包含 `pub using` 语句。"

#~ msgid "In `Double`, $c^2$ can be zero for non-zero $c$: $c^2$ underflows to $0$ for $|c| < 2^{-537}$ (rounding to nearest, with gradual underflow) even though $a/c$ may be finite. The checked quotient then reports a division by zero from the tangent. Such inputs are better rescaled; the [dual design](dual.md#rounding-error) assumes no underflow."
#~ msgstr "在 `Double` 中，非零的 $c$ 也可能使 $c^2$ 为零：当 $|c| < 2^{-537}$ 时（采用就近舍入并支持渐进下溢），$c^2$ 会下溢为 $0$，即使 $a/c$ 可能是有限值。这时带检查的商会因切向分量而报告除以零。这类输入最好先重新缩放；[dual 设计](dual.md#rounding-error) 假定不发生下溢。"

#~ msgid "First derivatives only. Higher derivatives come from nesting `Dual[Dual[T]]`, which costs $2^k$ per order; there is no truncated Taylor (jet) type."
#~ msgstr "只支持一阶导数。高阶导数通过嵌套 `Dual[Dual[T]]` 得到，其代价按阶数呈 $2^k$ 增长；没有截断泰勒（jet）类型。"

#~ msgid "Outside the open domain, the result follows `T`: for `Double`, `ln(0)` is $-\\infty$ with tangent $b/0$, and `sqrt` at $0$ has an infinite or NaN tangent."
#~ msgstr "在开定义域之外，结果沿用 `T` 的行为：对于 `Double`，`ln(0)` 为 $-\\infty$，切向分量为 $b/0$；`sqrt` 在 $0$ 处的切向分量为无穷大或 NaN。"

#~ msgid "If `f` is generic in its scalar, it can be applied to `Dual[Dual[T]]`. Differentiating $x \\mapsto f'(x)$ with dual numbers over `Dual[T]` gives"
#~ msgstr "如果 `f` 对其标量类型是泛型的，它就可以作用于 `Dual[Dual[T]]`。用 `Dual[T]` 上的对偶数对 $x \\mapsto f'(x)$ 求导，得到"

#~ msgid "because `diff(f, ·)` is itself a program built from dual operations (on the inner level). The outer and the inner tangent live in different types, so the classic *perturbation confusion* of untyped nested forward mode, where the inner derivative picks up the outer perturbation, is rejected by the type checker.[^siskind] Each nesting level doubles the number of components, so the $k$-th derivative costs $2^k$ times a plain evaluation."
#~ msgstr "因为 `diff(f, ·)` 本身就是一个由（内层的）对偶运算构建的程序。外层和内层的切向分量属于不同的类型，因此无类型嵌套前向模式中经典的*扰动混淆*（内层导数吸收了外层的扰动）会被类型检查器拒绝。[^siskind] 每嵌套一层，分量数就翻倍，因此 $k$ 阶导数的代价是普通求值的 $2^k$ 倍。"

